WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.166 --> 00:00:01.751
Put your hands, hooves,

00:00:01.751 --> 00:00:03.461
wings, and whatevers together

00:00:03.461 --> 00:00:05.630
for your guests of honor...

00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:07.006
... Pinecone and Pony!

00:00:08.383 --> 00:00:10.927
We're a couple of independent warriors

00:00:10.927 --> 00:00:12.387
whose only direction is... 

00:00:12.387 --> 00:00:13.847
adventure.

00:00:16.725 --> 00:00:17.517
Peh!

00:00:19.769 --> 00:00:21.730
Jousting, training...

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:23.106
...getting huge!

00:00:23.106 --> 00:00:26.651
And, we've gotta use the most
important muscle of all!

00:00:27.193 --> 00:00:27.986
Your biceps!

00:00:28.737 --> 00:00:29.487
Your mind.

00:00:29.487 --> 00:00:31.406
Ha ha! Of course!

00:00:34.242 --> 00:00:37.370
Pinecone and Pony never
back down from a challenge.

00:00:39.122 --> 00:00:41.166
C'mon, pal! Show me your tough face!

00:00:42.417 --> 00:00:44.377
Ehh... we'll work on it.

00:00:45.378 --> 00:00:46.796
It's not funny!

00:00:48.131 --> 00:00:48.923
Aargh!

00:00:48.923 --> 00:00:50.258
Aaah!

00:00:51.384 --> 00:00:53.970
Being a warrior isn't about what's in there...

00:00:53.970 --> 00:00:55.555
...it's about what's in here.

00:00:57.891 --> 00:01:00.518
Do I know my best friend, or what?

